WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.358
Expand a module.

2
00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:05.820
Click Modules, expand Market Basics, and choose its presentation.

3
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.622
The module groups related lessons together.

4
00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:16.048
Explore each part.

5
00:00:16.168 --> 00:00:20.684
Use Concepts, Examples, and Practice and summary within a module lesson.

6
00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:23.672
Next slide moves to the next lesson in the module.

7
00:00:24.707 --> 00:00:26.286
Review before the quiz.

8
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:30.214
Continue through the module presentation, then choose Start quiz.

9
00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:33.562
You can review the presentation before submitting answers.

